"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yb=7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"435e2f39-a5ed-458e-8d17-97c80edf04dc","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"あーそういう問題で悩んでいたのかー","ts":"1633269374.315400","edited":{"user":"UBQ2H65JQ","ts":"1633269479.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LFl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"95d8bf0c-dc0f-4a20-aa92-39de8076c7e2","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`://` 入りの URI っぽいバッファ名は特別扱いされて常に全体がバッファ名として扱われるっぽいのだけど、quickrun.vim ではバッファ名をオプションで変えられるので、そうなるとは限らない","ts":"1633269333.314800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Yl5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b0ec6d2f-6265-4744-a8de-a84961fc765f","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"パス、無限に考慮しないといけないことあって大変","ts":"1633269291.313700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ayrl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4dfb33a6-93ef-499d-963e-e9e45229cb9c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"quickrun.vim が前回使ったバッファを探してバッファを再利用するための処理なんですよね","ts":"1633269277.313100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"faT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e271088c-9495-4fe4-8741-1813d183c262","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"`bufname()`の結果が使いづらいのわかる","ts":"1633269270.313000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dGktm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1aea7c29-6c93-45b9-89de-badffaa020b4","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"パス処理って意外とめんどくさいですよね。","ts":"1633269243.312200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xCnI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2cb80288-3c17-4468-9f38-7d19737e9319","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"ファイルパスに限るならfnamemodify(,':p')でほぼほぼ解決しそうですけど","ts":"1633269225.311700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M5G0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d71d8bc6-acbb-4388-af74-39dbe2963ee9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`bufname()` の結果はカレントディレクトリに依存して相対パスになったり絶対パスになったりする ＼(^o^)／","ts":"1633269173.310700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tgV"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6edf01b2-d40d-4aa8-9459-119b912fb908","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"`x['name']` のところを `bufname(x['bufnr'])` にしないとダメかな","ts":"1633269141.310200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a+XC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c76ed3db-d365-4102-b90f-c167ecdffd31","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"まじか","ts":"1633269066.309300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ktgRR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6853a876-7f17-4c99-aff7-2faad856e4ec","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"`getbufinfo()` の結果の `.name` と `bufname()` の結果は違うのか… .name の方は常にフルパスが返ってくる","ts":"1633269049.309100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"TfyE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10cd7995-8892-4338-9873-2acc62856d6b","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"前回のエスケープ(`\\V`)、Windows でうまく行かないことがわかって、どうすれば適切にエスケープできるか何もわからなくなってのでこれ使わせてもらうことにしました :pray:","ts":"1633267758.308100","thread_ts":"1633032552.282900","subtype":"thread_broadcast","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UBQ2H65JQ"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tJTJA"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"f8e2222a-9402-4252-8046-dddc59d1c46c","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"まぁ、いまだったらgetbufinfo()があるから\n```function! s:strict_bufnr(name) abort\n\tfor x in getbufinfo()\n\t\tif bufname(x.bufnr) == a:name\n\t\t\treturn x.bufnr\n\t\tendif\n\tendfor\n\treturn -1\nendfunction```\nでいける","ts":"1633032552.282900","thread_ts":"1633032552.282900","edited":{"user":"UBQ2H65JQ","ts":"1633032661.000000"},"last_read":"1633267758.308100","subscribed":true,"reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"39Ry"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"d77af5bf-8f7e-4e9f-8d96-5f17e1e468bd","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"おお","ts":"1633193188.307800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3wC0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"20d20cf6-55e0-4070-ad89-662485cf9622","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"\u003chttp://www.drchip.org/astronaut/vim/syntax/vim.vim.gz\u003e\nおっ、最新のsyntax/vim.vimはちゃんとvimLetHereDocからcontains=vimComment,vim9Commentが消えている。(runtimeはまだ更新されていないけど。Dr.Chip++","ts":"1633193126.307500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["U03C71D7H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"83M"}]}]
